applyedAgainst.description:
A trigger can be one of two variants and apply to either a bundle or a quota. That is; it can either represent measure of consumption of one of two things; 
 * BUNDLE:	 An effectively prepaid/provisioned volume of credit for a specific service. 
* QUOTA: 	 A Credit Limit for the service. Once the subscription goes out of bundle, it starts accruing credit unit it reaches its Quota (credit Limit) the notification Trigger Point.

